			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync Element submodule with Monaco worker fixes and polyfill telemetry\n\nSubmodule synchronization bringing stability improvements across multiple components:\n1. Mountain: Fix 404s for extension webview assets by extending vscode-file URI handling to support arbitrary authorities beyond \"vscode-app\". Also reduce extension-scanner logging noise by capping ignore-related targets to Warn level.\n2. Output: Fix Monaco worker bootstrap crashes with InjectWorkerBootstrapShim (injects __name/__defProp shim into webWorkerServiceImpl.js blob factory) and RewriteNestedWorkerBootstrap (replaces .toString() pattern with JSON.stringified source). Switch RewriteStaticBlockSelfRef from hardcoded whitelist to auto-detection. Add __LAND_POLYFILL_TELEMETRY__ hook.\n3. Sky: Wire polyfill telemetry through PostHog bridge to capture errors via PH.captureException with categorized properties.\n4. Wind: Remove deprecated Electron polyfill shims as functionality moves to Mountain's native Rust implementations.\n\nImpact: Extension webview assets now load correctly, Monaco language workers no longer crash on startup, production polyfill failures are captured for debugging, and obsolete Electron shims are cleaned up.",
			"SHA": "cf08b5fec5bd1eead24636eadf43c81f8f5b9584"
		},
