			],
			"Message": "fix(CHANGELOG): Replace em dashes with en dashes for consistency\n\nSigned-off-by: Nikola Hristov <Nikola@PlayForm.Cloud>",
			"SHA": "d090d6d4030dc99ac4a7bdcb46a4aa1389bed063"
		},
		{
